ong>28 Days</strong> the military plans to <i>nuke everything</i> above ground in a last ditch effort to gain control. Unfortunately for you, the nearest bunker is <i>very far away</i>.<br><br>Will you <strong>fight</strong> your way to safety, or <i>succumb</i> to the Zed-pocalypse?",
